  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、美琴\r\n水、よかったら飲んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110020,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "3000250030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日は一段と冷えるな……\r\n美琴も風邪は引かないようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110030,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "うん、わかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだやっていくのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110040,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "もう少しだけ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり……すごいな、美琴は",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんな寒い日でもこれだけ練習できるなんて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110050,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そう？　普通だと思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "think2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、その普通がどれだけ難しいことか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110060,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……そうなのかな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうもんだよ\r\nここは素直に受け取ってくれればいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110070,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "わかった\r\nありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃ、俺は邪魔にならないように退散するよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日も雪が降ってるから気を付けて帰ってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110080,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "積もっているの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、積もってるみたいだ\r\n転ばないようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2025012110090,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうなんだ\r\n気を付けるね",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202501211/2025012110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
